redit (Amendment) Regulations 2007 (S.I. 2007/2151)</Citation>, <CitationSubRef CitationRef="cauo84ah4-00016" id="cauo84ah4-00017" URI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2007/2151/regulation/1" SectionRef="regulation-1">regs. 1</CitationSubRef>, <CitationSubRef CitationRef="cauo84ah4-00016" id="cauo84ah4-00018" URI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2007/2151/regulation/3/b" SectionRef="regulation-3-b" Operative="true">3(b)</CitationSubRef></Text></Para></Commentary><Commentary id="key-a14" Type="F"><Para><Text>Words in reg. 3(1) omitted (1.9.2008) by virtue of <Citation URI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2008/2169" id="caupwjbt4-00007" Class="UnitedKingdomStatutoryInstrument" Year="2008" Number="2169" Title="The Tax Credits (Miscellaneous Amendments) (No. 2) Regulations 2008">The Tax Credits (Miscellaneous Amendments) (No. 2) Regulations 2008 (S.I. 2008/2169)</Citation>, <CitationSubRef CitationRef="caupwjbt4-00007" id="caupwjbt4-00008" URI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2008/2169/regulation/1" SectionRef="regulation-1">regs. 1</CitationSubRef>, <CitationSubRef CitationRef="caupwjbt4-00007" id="caupwjbt4-00009" URI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2008/2169/regulation/8/1/a" SectionRef="regulation-8-1-a" Operative="true">8(1)(a)</CitationSubRef></Text></Para></Commentary><Commentary id="key-a16" Type="F"><Para><Text>Words in reg. 3(1) omitted (1.9.2008) by virtue of <Citation URI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2008/2169" id="caupwjbt4-00016" Class="UnitedKingdomStatutoryInstrument" Year="2008" Number="2169" Title="The Tax Credits (Miscellaneous Amendments) (No. 2) Regulations 2008">The Tax Credits (Miscellaneous Amendments) (No. 2) Regulations 2008 (S.I. 2008/2169)</Citation>, <CitationSubRef CitationRef="caupwjbt4-00016" id="caupwjbt4-00017" URI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2008/2169/regulation/1" SectionRef="regulation-1">regs. 1</CitationSubRef>, <CitationSubRef CitationRef="caupwjbt4-00016" id="caupwjbt4-00018" UR