08/1879" id="caurb3tv4-00007" Class="UnitedKingdomStatutoryInstrument" Year="2008" Number="1879" Title="The Employment and Support Allowance (Consequential Provisions) (No. 3) Regulations 2008">The Employment and Support Allowance (Consequential Provisions) (No. 3) Regulations 2008 (S.I. 2008/1879)</Citation>, <CitationSubRef CitationRef="caurb3tv4-00007" id="caurb3tv4-00008" URI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2008/1879/regulation/1/1" SectionRef="regulation-1-1">regs. 1(1)</CitationSubRef>, <CitationSubRef CitationRef="caurb3tv4-00007" id="caurb3tv4-00009" URI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2008/1879/regulation/22/2" SectionRef="regulation-22-2" Operative="true">22(2)</CitationSubRef></Text></Para></Commentary><Commentary id="key-a21" Type="F"><Para><Text>Words in reg. 3(1) substituted (6.4.2009) by <Citation URI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2009/697" id="caurnqaj4-00007" Class="UnitedKingdomStatutoryInstrument" Year="2009" Number="697" Title="The Tax Credits (Miscellaneous Amendments) Regulations 2009">The Tax Credits (Miscellaneous Amendments) Regulations 2009 (S.I. 2009/697)</Citation>, <CitationSubRef CitationRef="caurnqaj4-00007" id="caurnqaj4-00008" URI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2009/697/regulation/1/c" SectionRef="regulation-1-c">regs. 1(c)</CitationSubRef>, <CitationSubRef CitationRef="caurnqaj4-00007" id="caurnqaj4-00009" URI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2009/697/regulation/10" SectionRef="regulation-10" Operative="true">10</CitationSubRef></Text></Para></Commentary><Commentary id="key-a10" Type="F"><Para><Text>Words in reg. 3(1) substituted (15.7.2011) by <Citation URI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2011/1740" id="cauttipw4-00007" Class="UnitedKingdomStatutoryInstrument" Year="2011" Number="1740" Title="The Adoption and Children (Scotland) Act 2007 (Consequential Modifications) Order 2011">The Adoption and Children (Scotland) Act 2007 (Consequential Modifications) Order 2011 (S.I. 2011/1740)</Citati